    "multi-task joint prediction (EC + kcat + FBA feasibility)",
    "condition-specific FBA with GIMME/iMAT omics constraints",
    "pseudo-GPR inference for underground reactions",
    "active learning acquisition (EI + BALD) with Deep Ensemble",
    "unified cross-species workflow CLI"
  ]
